# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Project data (spec §0: data/ is gitignored and rebuilt by the commands in README.md).
# The exception is data/models/: those two models and their calibrators are deliberately frozen
# as the fixed reference point every number in README.md and docs/findings.md is quoted against,
# and committing them is what makes the README's five-minute path runnable from a clean clone.
# A directory excluded by `data/` cannot have its contents re-included, hence `data/*`.
data/*
!data/models/
data/models/*
!data/models/*.json
!data/models/*_calibrator.pkl
*.parquet
*.model

# Gold-set intermediates — regenerable from build_gold_labeling_kit.py, which appends new rows
# straight onto gold/labeling_filled.csv. gold/hard_cases.csv (the actual deliverable, spec §0)
# and gold/labeling_filled.csv (your raw answers — small, worth keeping) are NOT excluded.
gold/links-ambiguous-sample*.html

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
